# Docker build context exclusions. `crates/`, `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock`,
# `config/` and `migrations/` are the only paths the Dockerfiles copy (the
# migrations tree and config yaml are compile-time embeds of apex-store and
# apex-core).
.git
target
node_modules
scratch
screenshots
training
training_data
e2e
playwright-report
test-results
*.png
